DESCRIPTION:It's the place to be in Lancaster County PA on Sunday evening 
 June 28th! Congressional Candidate\, Nancy Mannion and the campaign team w
 ill be walking on the PA-462 bridge\, stretching between Wrightsville and 
 Columbia\, across the mighty and historic Susquehanna River. We are antici
 pating the lighting of all 26 piers of the old bridge that was destroyed i
 n the Civil War. We will start on the Columbia side at 6 pm and finish at 
 8 pm. It's Riverfest! https://susqnha.org/riverfest/
